    "body": "@NeoTech Review fixes in `48bfe892` (after your review, rebased onto `085a4717`):\n\n1. **Near plane**: ortho branch now uses `near = -((dist * 20.0).max(1000.0) - ORTHO_EYE_DIST)`.\n2. **New test**: `the_ortho_projection_keeps_a_point_in_front_of_the_eye_plane` — `dist = 300`, point at `target + 150 * back`, asserts `0.0 <= z / w <= 1.0` (\"the point in front of the eye plane must survive\").\n3. **Body lines**: Changelog added; no issue covers this viewport bug yet (you said the maintainer will file one).\n\n`law_tests.rs::the_ortho_depth_spans_zero_to_one_between_the_planes` updated to the new formula. `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` — 803 passed, 0 failed. Clippy clean. A maintainer will handle the merge; nothing else pending from our side.\n",
